---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | Tyler Foundation Pros"
  description="Important disclaimer regarding Tyler Foundation Pros as a lead generation and marketing service connecting homeowners with licensed foundation repair contractors."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">Marketing &amp; Lead Generation Service</h2>
        <p>Tyler Foundation Pro is a lead generation and marketing service. We connect homeowners with licensed foundation repair contractors in the Tyler, TX area. We are not a licensed contractor and do not perform foundation repair services. All work is performed by independent, licensed contractors.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">No Guarantees</h2>
        <p>We make no guarantees regarding the quality, safety, or outcome of any work performed by contractors referred through this service. Results may vary based on the specific conditions of your property, the scope of work required, and other factors outside our control.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">Verify Contractor Credentials</h2>
        <p>Always verify contractor licensing and insurance before hiring. You can verify a contractor's license status through the Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation (TDLR) or other applicable state and local licensing authorities.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">No Contractor Relationship</h2>
        <p>Tyler Foundation Pro does not employ, supervise, or control the independent contractors referred through this service. Any contract for foundation repair services is solely between you and the contractor you choose to hire. We are not a party to that agreement and assume no liability for the work performed.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">Informational Purposes Only</h2>
        <p>The content on this website is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute professional engineering, structural, or legal advice. Consult a licensed structural engineer or contractor for advice specific to your property.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this disclaimer, call us at <a href="tel:9035827837" class="text-brand font-semibold hover:underline">(903) 582-7837</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
